🟢 8. Smart waiting framework (advanced companies)

Instead of raw Selenium waits, they build:

def wait_click(driver, locator):
    WebDriverWait(driver, 10).until(
        EC.element_to_be_clickable(locator)
    ).click()

👉 Centralized wait utilities reduce flakiness massively.

🔴 9. Test independence rule

Companies enforce:

✔ No test depends on another test
✔ Each test creates its own data
✔ Clean setup/teardown

Bad example:

test_login() → test_checkout() depends on login ❌

Good:

each test logs in independently ✔


